05/02", weight="75", tooltip="NEIRA Girls Fours, BB&N, Middlesex, NCDS			
Distance: 1300 Conditions: Head wind, consistent direction 6-10kts variable speed. Wind picked up once through bridges. Light chop Comments: Thank you Middlesex for making the trip to Boston, BB&N for hosting Middlesex ant their site, and to all coaches who supported on the water. A great day of racing, race order 3,4,1,2 to allow hot seats. 4V event saw oars clashing just through River Street Bridge. Neither crew gained or lost considerable momentum and coxswains and crews recovered effectively making for exciting racing.
